Worm was added in '''Beta 30.0''' as a [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Generate Generated] monster from [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Jar_of_Worms Jar of Worms]. It became a craftable [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Common Common] monster in '''Beta 40.0''', where its effect was also corrected by stating it only works when dealing DMG to a monster.

'''Beta 47.0''' gave it -1/-1, dropping it from 1/3 to 0/2. Its cost was also reduced from 2G to 0G, making it the 2nd craftable 0G monster (after [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Tiny_Froggit Tiny Froggit]).

